_.&rdquo;</p><p><strong>Watch the scope.</strong> A claim about a decade is 3,653 days. Ask what share of it your source can actually witness.</p></div></div><div id="print-worksheet-supported" class="print-section"><h2>Independent Work – Supported</h2><div class="prevent-break"><p><strong>Spectrum Board Record</strong></p><p>1) My placements (source → position):</p><div class='print-line'></div><div class='print-line'></div><p>2) The detail that placed my strongest card:</p><div class='print-line'></div><p>3) Verdict frame completed:</p><div class='print-line'></div></div></div><div id="print-worksheet-standard" class="print-section"><h2>Independent Work – Standard</h2><div class="prevent-break"><p><strong>How Far — Full Answer</strong></p><p>1) Support 1 + cited detail:</p><div class='print-line'></div><p>2) Support 2 + cited detail:</p><div class='print-line'></div><p>3) Limit + cited detail:</p><div class='print-line'></div><p>4) Discount applied (name it):</p><div class='print-line'></div><p>5) Measured verdict:</p><div class='print-line'></div></div></div><div id="print-worksheet-stretch" class="print-section"><h2>Independent Work – Stretch</h2><div class="prevent-break"><p><strong>Two Claims, One Source Set</strong></p><p>1) Spectrum for claim A (summary line):</p><div class='print-line'></div><p>2) Spectrum for claim B (summary line):</p><div class='print-line'></div><p>3) Which sources shifted, and why:</p><div class='print-line'></div><div class='print-line'></div><p>4) Dual verdicts, both measured:</p><div class='print-line'></div><div class='print-line'></div></div></div><div id="print-exit" class="print-section"><div class="supported-content"><h2>Exit Ticket – Supported</h2><p>1) Name the four spectrum positions.</p><div class='print-line'></div><p>2) Why can't one photo carry 'through the 1900s'?</p><div class='print-line'></div><p>3) Every position must cite its…?</p><div class='print-line'></div><div class="print-section" id="print-lundy"><h2>Lundy L